    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IEw">I Ew</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be mansworenum.] [Ld] Eac we cwædon be þam mannum ðe mánsworan wæran, gif ðæt geswutelod wære, oððe him að burste oððe ofercyðed wære, þæt hy siððan aðwyrðe næran, ac ordales wyrðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">We have further declared, with regard to men who have been accused of perjury: if the charge has been proved, or if the oath on their behalf has collapsed, or has been overborne by more strongly supported testimony, never again shall they have the privilege of clearing themselves by oaths but only by the ordeal.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Eac we cwædon be ðam mannum ðe mansworan wæron, gif þæt geswytelod wære, oððe him að burste oððe ofercyðed wære, þæt hy syððan aðwyrðe næron, ac ordales wyrðe.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
